{
  "ledger": [
    "Car (vintage wood-panel SUV) | front aimed frame-left, cream body with wood side panels, roof rack, thin antenna and twin round hood lamps on front-left of hood, chrome door mirror at A-pillar | same configuration at end, viewed closer and more side-on | camera orbits from front three-quarter to side close-up; all fixed car features keep their relative positions (lamps in front of antenna, mirror at front of door, rack over cabin)",
    "Woman in driver's (left) front seat | leaning out of open left side window, arms crossed, forearms resting on door line just behind A-pillar; head and torso above beltline | same pose and location at end, closer | she remains in the left front door opening the whole time; her body occludes the cabin interior/seat behind the window; hair streams toward frame-right (rear), consistent with forward motion of the car",
    "Road | paved two-lane highway with dashed yellow centerline and white edge lines running parallel along the car's left side, visible at frame-left from ~0:03 onward | same road at end, blurred, markings shifted toward frame-right | markings and roadside utility poles stream left-to-right at a steady rate, compatible with the vehicle/camera traveling forward along the road; no change in road geometry or side",
    "Desert and mountains | flat desert with dry grass clumps and low mountain ridge on the horizon beyond the car's front | same at end | background pans gently in the direction expected as the camera rotates from front to side; no elements pop in from wrong directions",
    "Front-end occlusion set | hood, wipers at cowl, grille and front bumper occlude the ground and road behind them; antenna rises from hood and is occluded only by the windshield frame at steep angles | consistent at end | no background element ever renders over the hood or body panels; occlusion edges shift smoothly with the orbit"
  ],
  "findings": []
}
